Before you try to build the example in this directory, make sure
that your environment is properly set up, i.e. that you have run
one of the scripts (nslenv.sh or nslenv.csh) that set up NSLHOME, 
PATH, LibraryPath variables for your installation.

If you have not run them, do so now. They are in 
<installation_directory>/scripts

To build the example, do
	make Makefile; make

This will create ccolor and icolor, the compiled and interpreted executables
that display the colors available.

This example illustrates how you can create interface elements 
dynamically, using projects in XFaceMaker.

To remove the example built, do
	make clean